# Contents rather than the directory itself: git cannot re-include a path below an excluded
# directory, and repo-owned skills are part of the project's conventions so they are versioned with
# the code. Everything else under .claude/ stays machine-local (settings.local.json, task locks).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
